      "observed": "The netlist contains U9, a 74LVC1G86 single XOR gate. U9 pin 2 is connected to the AP63203WU bootstrap node together with C13 pin 2 and U8 pin 6 (BST); U9 pin 1 is connected to ESP32 GPIO8; U9 pin 4 is connected to U4 pin 8, the MAX31855 NC pin; U9 pin 5 is +3V3 and U9 pin 3 is GND.",
      "expected": "The intended design has no U9 in the power or thermocouple architecture. C13 is only the bootstrap capacitor between U8 SW and U8 BST, and U4 pin 8 should be unconnected like U2/U3 pin 8. A 3.3 V CMOS gate input should not be attached to a buck bootstrap node that can be pulled above the logic supply.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"U9\")"
        },
