        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"U9\") (pin \"2\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"36\") (name \"Net-(U9-Pad4)\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"U4\") (pin \"8\") (pinfunction \"NC\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"U9\") (pin \"4\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "Pin 8 (`NC`) is left unconnected on all three parts (confirmed: `unconnected-(U2/U3/U4-NC-Pad8)` nets in `controller.net`)."
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "`U8` `SW`(5) drives the buck inductor `L1` (3.9 µH) and bootstrap cap `C13`"
        },
        {
          "source": "spice",
          "quote": "C13 Net-_U8-SW_ Net-_U9-Pad2_ 100n"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The added gate input on the bootstrap node can clamp or over-stress the node relative to +3V3, disturbing AP63203WU start-up and regulation; the connection to U4 NC also violates the intended thermocouple netlist.",
      "confidence": 0.86
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Anomaly detected: an unintended 74LVC1G86 XOR gate (U9) is inserted into the buck bootstrap net and tied to a thermocouple NC pin, contradicting the specified power and thermocouple architecture."
}

